+"""Tests for Exp 4828 cross-family-transfer SOTA ingestion.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-ARC-WMTE-4828, SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4828,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4828-NO-FABRICATION.
+"""
+
